fix = "The owner decided: a server-side route calls a configurable OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint named by server environment variables with the default model xai/grok-4.7, and the search panel shows the answer (decision 2652, task 22.35.10)."

[gotcha.3238]
title = "22.31.560 attempt 2: the two tenants of gotcha 3219 are gone and the native_send_preview_evm cases pass; native_send_first_prepare_and_reopened_prepare_match_owner_preview still answers 503 owner.unavailable on the first Prepare, and the daemon log now names the origin: preparation receipt key read failed, Sequencer(Rpc(RpcRefusal -32601 Method not found)); the first verify of the attempt had stopped earlier with bootstrap peer NotFound because the EVM node binary was not on the path."
