[gotcha.3239]
title = "22.31.565 attempt 1: the agent stopped with no change inside scope and no gate run, reporting that the task path services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/approval.rs does not exist at the base 2e0a668a79; the hold code the task describes (HOLD_KEY_PREFIX line 24, the tenant listing lines 205 to 225, approval_window_expired line 1196, validate_replayed line 1439, encode_hold line 1485, decode_legacy_hold line 1638) lives in src/policy/approval.rs, and src/approval/ is a separate module directory (mod.rs, expiry.rs, call_bound.rs, the native presentation files)."
