[gotcha.3242]
title = "22.35.9 attempt 1: the stats assertion passes (total_blocks is the consensus block height); the two chain page cases fail with Phoenix.Router.NoRouteError for GET / because BlockScoutWeb.Router forwards the root to BlockScoutWeb.Routers.WebRouter only when the web router is enabled at compile time (router.ex lines 8 and 115 to 117), and the configuration enables it only when DISABLE_WEBAPP is false with a default of true (apps/block_scout_web/config/config.exs lines 72 to 73); the test build does not set it and the deployment sets DISABLE_WEBAPP=true (services/explorer/deploy/env/backend.example.env line 115)."
