[gotcha.3267]
title = "22.31.478 attempt 11: the build passed (exit 0), then the dependent-crate check stopped with exit 101 compiling layerx-agentd on the compat.rs line 8 include of services/agent/COMPATIBILITY.md (gotcha 3263); the verify never ran, so the Fund completion and the gas figures of the attempt-11 tree are implemented but unqualified."
