fix = "22.39.65 now requires 22.31.620 and attempt 2 continues from the attempt-1 tree once the mirror repair is on main (the rule of gotcha 3443)."

[gotcha.3453]
title = "The wallet suite-scope test rejected a suite outside the Vitest include patterns and the full run failed in surfaces another task owns"
symptom = "22.39.43 attempt 1 at cc9ee73d4a2c brought the eleven drifted wallet test files in line; its first verification failed in tests/ci/test_wallet_repair_suites_listed.py because apps/wallet/src/account/test/repair-22-33-162.test.ts lies outside the include patterns of apps/wallet/vitest.config.ts line 14 (src/**/*.test.ts and src/**/*.test.tsx match it, yet the repair record next to it lists a suite path the scope test cannot map), and the second verification ran the whole wallet suite and reported 47 failures in 21 files, most of them in the surfaces suites (ExchangeView, WebDataView, LaunchpadView, FeeChoice and the chain surface test) that task 22.39.55 owns."
fix = "22.39.43 now requires 22.39.55 so the surfaces baseline is settled before the whole-suite verification runs; attempt 2 maps the account suite in the scope test and keeps the eleven files."

[gotcha.3454]
title = "Nine wallet surface assertions fail because the recorded receipt producer has no vector for the calls they make"
symptom = "22.39.55 attempt 1 at c4b593a8cfd7 recorded the 27-case baseline and settled 18 cases (126 tests, 97 passed); the nine remaining failures are four ExchangeView cases, three WebDataView cases (proof_layerxledger_0x101a among them), one LaunchpadView case and one FeeChoice case, each raising the error no node receipt vector for this call from apps/wallet/src/surfaces/test/chain.tsx line 159, which means apps/wallet/src/surfaces/test/recordedReceipts.ts holds no recorded vector for the method and parameters the surface sends. The first build also failed on a TS2305 import of a locks member from the Node thread module in two widget tests, fixed in the second build."
fix = "22.39.55 attempt 2 records the missing vectors in the recorded receipt producer from the node fixture under apps/wallet/src/surfaces/test/fixtures; the producer file and the fixture directory join the touches."

[gotcha.3455]
title = "The tag-gated Go verification combined two mutually exclusive build tags and ran the whole tree under them"
symptom = "22.39.82 attempt 1 at 4c33ac989e9e wired the tagged matrix, the Autobahn and registry jobs and the wiring tests; the verification ran go test with -tags=mock_block_validation,mock_chain_validation over ./consensus/..., and consensus/types/consensus_policy_mock_chain_validation.go line 25 redeclares ConsensusPolicy.HandleError already declared by consensus_policy_mock_block_validation.go line 13, because the two mock files are alternatives to consensus_policy_default.go (built only without either tag) and were never meant to build together; the packages that compiled then failed in TestRepair_79_HeaderBudgetRejectsOversize (the mock accepts the oversize header) and in a lane range panic of the data package, both effects of running the whole tree with validation mocked."
fix = "Decision 2817: mutually exclusive tags verify in separate legs over the packages they gate; the verification of 22.39.82 runs each mock tag alone over ./consensus/types/... and the registry tests."

[gotcha.3456]
title = "The process-numbering guard scanned the specification tree and found eighteen lines in twelve product pages outside its touches"
symptom = "22.39.66 attempt 1 at 83e936a7ccc3 rewrote its nine pages and wrote the three guard tests; the verification reported 713 offending lines, 697 of them inside spec/layerx-merge (BUILD-REPORT.md, the architecture pages) and spec/release-v6-12-0, which are the engineering record and not product documentation, and 18 lines in twelve pages outside the touches: docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-checklist.md line 72, docs/release/7.0.0-service-operator-runbook.md lines 17, 63, 215 and 249, docs/release/7.0.0-upgrade-plan.md lines 32 and 133 (decision 2521), sdk/platform/jvm/README.md line 277, services/interop/crates/layerx-migrate/README.md line 30, sdk/contrib/rosetta/node/README.md line 29, tools/launchpad/production/load/README.md line 124, tests/fixtures/custody/paxeer-light-v1/README line 49, the committed fixtures README of the human test-support crate line 5, and repair-record prose in the mirror crate README line 178, the transport-a2a conformance README line 67, the hosted gateway README line 213 and the smart-contract-verifier server README line 569."
fix = "Decision 2811: the guard excludes the spec tree; attempt 2 rewrites the twelve pages, which join the touches."

[gotcha.3457]
