symptom = "22.39.63 attempt 1 at bc04f6d249a3 set the identifiers in its 29 touched manifests and wrote the three tests; the verification listed 187 manifests without a licence: 111 under the vendored project directory under tools/, which the allowlist of the test omitted although the task text excluded the vendored trees, 64 first-party example, test and fixture manifests outside the touches (the services/platform examples and samples, the agent test and fuzz crates, the loadtest contracts, the porting reference crates, the integration examples, the .NET test projects, the Android gradle files, the perps and web helper packages and eight CosmWasm example contracts under tests/fixtures) and the three testdata manifests of the bridge, launchpad and wallet services; the author test found five manifests not naming the organisation (contracts/package.json, the three chainflow SDK manifests naming the product, tests/integration/dapp_tests/package.json)."
