symptom = "22.39.61 attempt 2 at 3b4cfe9e8827 was claimed at 14:47Z against base 6c921e5e1d, three minutes before the batch that replaced its build command landed as db78a74d45; it ran the former command and failed the same way as attempt 1 (TS2307 cannot find module @kindle/sdk in 78 files) because the launchpad SDK packages were never built, exit 2 before verification."
