[gotcha.3459]
title = "The qualification settlement task named three files while its suite failures spanned 82 modules and two libraries absent from the environment"
symptom = "22.31.623 attempt 1 at 3d7128cbbf39 added the two regression tests and a 268-entry repair record, then ran the whole tools/qualification suite twice: 166 failures and one error remain (4273 passed), led by test_repair_22_31_392 (19), test_repair_22_33_806 (10), test_repair_22_31_451 (9), test_repair_22_33_733 (8), the proof qualification CLI tests (7) and test_px_node_root_design (6, px_register contract changed or abbreviated). The record states that 82 baseline modules lie outside the three touched files and that 98 baseline entries failed importing Crypto.Hash.keccak and four modules jsonschema, both absent from the environment and installed ad hoc during the attempt."
fix = "Decision 2812: the settlement task owns the producers its suite names and its touches name the suite directory; the suite declares its libraries in tools/qualification/requirements.txt, which the build installs."

