[gotcha.3462]
title = "The public check readiness sweep found ten repair groups and nine owner settings"
symptom = "A read-only pass over the 56 tracked workflow files and the last runs on main found: the launchpad and sdk/wallet test jobs run pnpm against the root npm workspace and fail with This project is configured to use npm (9 of 11 launchpad jobs); the launchpad web tests fail in 8 files with a 500 wallet_read_failed error and one mobile offline-cache case; the wallet Go check links against the programs library archive that its job never builds and carries a stale copy of the layerxpay ABI; the explorer image check runs the backend tests without solc or vyper (160 failures and 33 invalid in the explorer app, 8 in ethereum_jsonrpc); the scheduled platform jobs read 29 secrets and about 110 variables unconditionally; three unused secrets reach every integration-test matrix job; third-party sources are fetched by tag; the Rust toolchain action installs stable against the pinned 1.91.1 and Foundry is pinned at four settings; runner labels mix ubuntu-24.04 and ubuntu-latest; the two release workflows duplicate a 28-line toolchain block and two lanes run in two workflows each. Owner settings: 61 of 63 secret names and 111 of 116 variable names absent, no runner for the self-hosted label, branch protection requiring only the CodeQL and CodeRabbit checks with enforcement for administrators off, SHA pinning not required, Pages not enabled, and 44 workflows disabled."
fix = "Tasks 22.39.94 to 22.39.103 carry the ten groups; the owner settings are recorded for the repository owner."

[gotcha.3463]
title = "The dependency and container sweep found twelve repair groups"
symptom = "A read-only pass over 12 pnpm, 21 npm, 11 yarn, 215 Cargo and 32 Go lockfiles, the beta and offchain image tables and the explorer image matrix found: the root npm lockfile disagrees with 14 workspace entries and the root also tracks an unused pnpm lockfile and workspace file; the apps/perps lockfile lacks the two PGlite packages the wallet gateway importer declares; five pnpm releases are pinned across manifests, images and workflows and two workspaces have no lockfile; the layerx image excludes three compile-time include_str targets of its x-websearch stage; the registry image excludes docker/platform-registry/chain-trust.py that its base stage copies; the explorer sig-provider and verifier images build from a floating third-party base without --locked and the sig-provider runs on ubuntu:20.04 with libssl1.1; six table images use floating base tags, hpx-registry builds on end-of-life golang:1.22-alpine and alpine:3.20 and localnode pipes a Node 16 setup script into a shell; the compose files name a Docker Hub namespace and latest tags; the four .NET projects target net8.0 whose support ends on 2026-11-10; Node, Python and Go floors name end-of-life releases; the core image tags, the make-built paxd version and the node API documents do not carry v7.0.0; twelve first-party packages are not at 0.1.0."
fix = "Tasks 22.39.104 to 22.39.115 carry the twelve groups under decisions 2813 to 2816; the owner items (ECR targets, libwasmvm builders, Go module paths, the explorer upstream version, the vendored lockfile drift, seven Cargo roots without a lock, the unbuilt launchpad and perps web images, cross-major splits) are recorded for the repository owner."

