symptom = "Task 18.1689.1 attempt 1 at 6148d21d4ef6 passed tsc and failed its verification: middlewareConfigurationErrorsRemainRenderable in apps/launchpad/web/src/core/backend-origins.test.ts took 5805 ms and vitest reported Test timed out in 5000ms at the registration on line 232, which passes the function and its name without a time-out; the eight other cases of the file were skipped by the name filter. The scenario reconfigures the environment four times and imports the wagmi configuration, the RPC module and the middleware after each reset."
fix = "Attempt 2 registers the scenario with a thirty-second time-out as the third registration argument and records the measured wall time in the task record, the pattern of gotcha 3833."

