symptom = "Task 18.1747.1 attempt 3 at 78162078f463 built and failed native_approval_clock_units and native_producer_clock_units at services/human/crates/layerx-human-service/tests/repair_22_33_63.rs line 1641: the bootstrap peer panicked with Refused(native access custody refused), the error native_send.rs line 445 returns when sign_native_consent_in_scope of the custody fails for the human-primary key of the scope principal with the SecuritySettings authorization and the step-up evidence. Attempts 1 and 2 cleared the trace identifier format and an Unavailable peer answer at earlier steps of the same bootstrap; the sibling fixtures at lines 1814 and 1897 pass the custody of the fixture."
fix = "Attempt 4 runs the bootstrap to completion against the real producers before finishing: the custody passed to authorize_access holds the human-primary key for the scope principal and signs the SecuritySettings authorization with the evidence the step-up produced, and every later refusal of the sequence is repaired in the same cycle."

[gotcha.3861]
title = "Three restored platform workflow jobs call reusable workflows and carry no runner, so the routed-runner case indexes a missing key"
symptom = "Task 18.1843.1 attempt 2 at 9a2ea5562335 failed test_restored_job_keeps_routed_runs_on for platform.yml jobs programs-acceptance, agent-sanitizers and agent-fuzz-corpus with KeyError: runs-on at tests/ci/test_workflow_runs_on_routed.py line 113: those jobs invoke .github/workflows/programs-conformance.yml and .github/workflows/agent.yml through uses: with inputs, and a calling job has no runs-on by the workflow syntax; the called workflows carry the routed expression on their jobs (agent.yml lines 31, 87, 119, 144, 160 and 222; programs-conformance.yml lines 68, 105, 120 and 189, with a matrix runner at line 149). The sixteen other restored jobs passed."
fix = "Decision 3085: a restored job that calls a reusable workflow is asserted through the called workflow, every job of which carries the routed runner or a matrix runner whose values are routed or listed hosted labels; attempt 3 teaches the case to follow uses:."

[gotcha.3862]
title = "The embedded wallet case imports modules that evaluate the perps gateway origin at load, before the case can set it"
symptom = "Task 18.1803.1 attempt 2 at 08bdd71e1f4a failed its verification before any case ran: apps/perps/src/core/network/gateway.ts line 44 evaluates parseGatewayOrigin(process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_PERPS_GATEWAY_URL) at module load and threw NEXT_PUBLIC_PERPS_GATEWAY_URL is not set while tsx loaded tests/embedded-wallet.test.ts, whose static imports now reach the gateway module. Other perps cases set the origin ahead of those imports (tests/exact-money.test.ts line 8, tests/book-levels.test.ts line 4 with a placeholder origin)."
fix = "Attempt 3 sets the gateway origin before the modules that read it evaluate, with the placeholder origin the sibling cases use, making the gateway-reaching imports dynamic if static hoisting evaluates them first; no production module changes."

[gotcha.3863]
title = "The parity inventory run fails fifteen rows for three causes: a native prerequisite build, a selector without a Makefile binary and producer tests red on the merged revision"
symptom = "Task 17.4.6 attempt 2 at b3c5607ece37 failed test_parity_rows_pass_on_merged_revision: seven rows did not run because the native prerequisite make evmone-lib failed (the row log names evmone-lib.log, which the attempt did not copy into its record); the kernel replay corpus row ran make build/tests/test_qual_replay, a target the root Makefile does not declare (lines 1184 to 1199 declare build/tests/test_qual_replay_tail for tests/test_qual_replay_tail.c, while spec/layerx-merge/programme/data/parity.kvx line 49 selects tests/test_qual_replay.c::main, a source with no declared binary); and the gateway rows failed on cargo test one_source_reads of layerx-platform-gateway twice and the x-websearch binary test once, cases owned by other tasks of the programme."
fix = "Decision 3086 separates the three causes: the tooling repairs (prerequisite log in the record, selector resolution) belong to attempt 3; a row red on the own test of its producer is a finding against the producer recorded in qualification.kvx, after which the task ends implemented-not-qualified until the producers land."

[gotcha.3864]
