symptom = "Task 22.39.117 attempt 10 at f87ba784d3e1 failed TestReconcileCreationFeeAcceptsSurfaceTreasury, TestReconcileCreationFeeRejectsSurfaceTreasuryWithImplementation, the five sub-cases of TestPinnedPreflightCurrentNativeSurfaces and the TestRepair_38 native cases in sdk/launchpad/shared/chain: every surface (Router, ProtocolConfig, Quoter, SidioraFactory, SidioraNFT, Treasury, FeeAccumulator) reported committed runtime hash 0x6302ff80f4168c2af23afbf3117c613edd66d288d120eee825f9ecadd43a392f where the pin wants 0xe67f4b121cfa00710e9a74cd027b8d56f7ca67d14ebe357a8c080f8c2e819993 (sdk/launchpad/shared/chain/client.go line 1050, config/deployment/current.json lines 19 to 34, attest_surface_test.go line 71). The manifest is an explicitly reviewed record of the live deployment (generate.py never queries a network); the gate node runs the runtime of the tree, which changes at the upgrade height."
fix = "Decision 3084 stages the runtime hash of the tree beside the live pin; attempt 11 records the staged hash in the manifest and lets the client and the cases admit the active or the staged runtime."

[gotcha.3865]
