symptom = "Task 18.1667.1 attempt 9 at 216f58a857: after the receipt binding repair the vector vector-v1-programs-positive reverts (submit protocol 3, activity 0x00090003, ABI 1) with LXP_ERR_MODULE_DISABLED at tests/programs/main_test.go:320; src/modules/programs/deploy.c upgrade_policy_authorized (:548 to :583) returns at the comparison of the upgrade authority with the authority principal and, when they differ under LXP_PROTOCOL_VERSION_STATE_COMMITMENT, derives the agent main account and needs the transfer runtime accounts the fixture host does not provide, so it returns LXP_ERR_MODULE_DISABLED at :583; precompiles/layerxprograms/method_deploy_test.go:92 to :95 sets the upgrade authority to the authority principal for policy 1"
fix = "The vector deploys with the upgrade authority equal to the authority principal, the form method_deploy_test.go uses, and the kernel check returns at the principal comparison"

[gotcha.3997]
title = "The restart fixture expects the receipt amount to equal the budget spend while the producer records the transaction value"
symptom = "Task 18.1724.1 attempt 9 at 444abad99bf5: TestCurrentReceiptRestartFixture at rpc/receipt_equality_test.go:482 expects the receipt amount 25 (the budget spend) and reads 0; node/sequencer/receipt.go:426 sets the receipt amount from the transaction value, precompiles/layerxpay/layerxpay.go:163 requires a zero value on every pay call and reads the spend from the calldata, and services/agent/crates/layerx-crypto/src/evm_transaction.rs:315 refuses a nonzero value; the daemon support services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/support/current_node.rs builds a receipt with amount 25 by hand (sequencer_receipt_with_details) and tests/outbox_recover.rs:361 commits the budget with the same 25"
fix = "Decision 3128: the receipt amount is the transaction value and the spend is the committed budget state; the fixture and the daemon support assert each value against its producer"

[gotcha.3998]
title = "The explorer backend suite needs a Postgres the qualification environment never provisions because the explorer reads a bare TEST_DATABASE_URL from an .exs file"
symptom = "Task 22.39.271 attempt 1 at 7482c7b35: mix test apps/explorer/test/explorer/chain/paxeer_x fails because Explorer.Repo cannot create its database at localhost:5432 (connection refused); services/explorer/backend/apps/explorer/config/test.exs reads TEST_DATABASE_URL without a prefix through ConfigHelper.parse_url_env_var and falls back to localhost:5432 explorer_test, and the environment detection matched only prefixed variables and never scanned .exs files"
fix = "The qualification environment detects the bare TEST_DATABASE_URL in .exs files and exports a database for it before the gate"

[gotcha.3999]
title = "The market fuel cases read a fixture directory that a Go test of the node writes and the task verification never runs that test"
symptom = "Task 22.38.13 attempt 1 at ff3180d432: the fuel_budget cases fail at programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/tests/fuel_budget.rs:1856 with owner: No such file or directory, run the declared Go fixture gate first; measured_fund_cpu_fuel (:1853) and the attribution case (:1639) read programs/target/repair-478 (owner, asset, create, fund, current) which rpc/repair_478_test.go writes (repair478RunObserved :508 to :522, TestRepair478_FundWithinProductionAllowance :574, TestFundConsumptionAttribution :190, guest sizes at :184), so the Rust cases depend on a Go producer the build step must run first"
fix = "Decision 3129: the build step runs the two Go tests of rpc/repair_478_test.go before the cargo build"

[gotcha.4000]
title = "The production export answers export.invalid_proof for every refusal of the offline export operation so the failing stage is invisible"
symptom = "Task 18.1752.1 attempt 6 at a411e0fcaf: tests/issue_1752.rs:960 expects 200 from the production export and reads 500 with class VerificationFailure, reason export.invalid_proof, retriability Terminal; the reason comes from the closure at services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/agent_rpc_adapters.rs:1921 which offline_export_operation applies at nine sites (the response check, the fact selector, the artifact encoding and the decoding of the committed bundle), while the attempt-5 note pointed only at export::verify of export.rs; the daemon served px_getReceiptKeys, pax_sequencerReceipt, eth_getProof, commit and block_results, so the bundle was fetched and the refusal is in its verification"
fix = "The attempt logs the refusing site of offline_export_operation at each application of the closure, prints the daemon log in the case message and repairs the stage it names; agent_rpc_adapters.rs joins the touches"

