[gotcha.4040]
title = "Concurrent additions to the retired-callers catalogue conflict textually on the same list tail"
symptom = "Three qualified repairs (22.39.247 attempt 2 at 802b20fcf830, 22.39.297 attempt 2 at 21cc035c4105 and 18.1752.1 attempt 7 at 5484ea469ed9) could not be integrated onto their domain branches: each appended entries to allowed_references of tools/paxeer-x/retired_callers.json at the end of the list, as another repair already on the branch had, so the three-way text merge reports a conflict in the catalogue although the additions are independent. The same conflict kept the agent and kernel domain branches from merging into main for a day."
fix = "Decision 3142: the catalogue merges by three-way union of its object lists; the integration resolved the three repairs and the two branches that way and the scanner validates the merged catalogue."

[gotcha.4041]
title = "The wallet gateway suite keeps thirty-nine residual cases after the base comparison"
symptom = "Task 22.39.290 attempt 2 at c14d6aaf9117: the attempt ran the suite at the base revision 7c65ca246479 (75 failed, 325 passed) and classified the causes in services/wallet/gateway/repair_22_39_290.kvx, but pnpm --dir services/wallet/gateway run test still fails 39 cases in 17 files (evm-sign, e2e/gateway.e2e, backfill-command, attestor, repair-22-31-370, provisioning, agent-precompiles-scheduler, repair-22-31-371, proof_s27_embedded_wallet_gateway, sign-client-nonce, owner-broadcast-outcome, agent-precompiles-streams, precompiles, repair-22-33-210, sponsor-budget, schemas.injection, support/chain-sequencer-receipt), among them the scheduler and streams settle routes that never reach eth_estimateGas and the custody snapshot error that is not an AttestorQuorumError; exit 1, log /out/logs/verify-2.log. The environment causes do_3 named were classified but not repaired."
fix = "Attempt 3 repairs every environment cause of the record in the seventeen files and leaves the product causes listed."

[gotcha.4042]
title = "The launchpad statistics module fails eight cases once the ranking module is green"
symptom = "Task 22.39.168 attempt 7 at 4e70cd690089: the three ranking cases of do_12 pass, and the statistics module then fails eight cases in five packages: internal/app TestRepair_70_CrossWalletCatchupAndRestart (repair_70_test.go:274) and internal/consumer TestCanonicalLegacyBridgeReplaysRealPaxeerPool (canonical_legacy_test.go:190) with store: canonical fee evidence unavailable: projection required, produced at internal/store/platform.go:200 when the canonical accounting projection is absent; internal/httpapi TestPlatformRoute (cache_test.go:195, status 500) and TestPrecomputePublishesPlatformUpdate; internal/projectionstats TestPhase3ActualReceiptProcessCrashAndBrokerRedelivery and TestPhase3CanonicalOpticalFeesAgainstIndependentIntegers; internal/search TestRealBrokerInboxProjectionAndOutboxAtomicity, whose real broker connection fails the TLS handshake with a certificate signed by an unknown authority (capacity_test.go:814 builds its client from the system certificate pool); exit 1, log /out/logs/verify-2.log."
