[gotcha.4043]
title = "The JVM catalogue programs test expects the native preparation record of the schema before its regeneration"
symptom = "Task 17.5.7 attempt 9 at 0b7715be4a92: the wave 6 gate fails inside make platform-jvm-dependencies-install, mvn -f sdk/platform/jvm/pom.xml install, at GeneratedCatalogueProgramsTest.nativePrepareCarriesThePreparationRecord (GeneratedCatalogueProgramsTest.java:214): the expected field set is version, preparation_id, canonical_bytes, signing_preimage and approval_id (:141) but the generated NativePrepareResultV1 (GeneratedSchema.java:553, regenerated at dd11131421 by task 22.39.237) carries activity and approval_required as well, the components contain activity (:172), and the fixture record without activity no longer decodes (Missing required creator property activity); exit 1, log /out/logs/verify-2.log. Task 22.39.287 aligned the test against a schema without the three fields."
fix = "Decision 3144 and task 22.39.301 align the test with the generated record; 17.5.7 requires 22.39.301."

[gotcha.4044]
title = "The committed-fixture recorder binds an address the V1 Programs authority already bound"
symptom = "Task 18.1667.1 attempt 12 at 32280073332c: with the module runtime present, TestRecorderAllSelectedV6Executes fails at daemon/committed-fixture/main_test.go:388 because the vector-v4-committed recorder step bind DID 0 reverts with LXP_ADDR_LAYERX_ADDRESS_BOUND (evm address is already bound to a did): the fixture now binds the V1 Programs deployment authority (vector_v1_programs.go, the bindLayerX call and the caller binding check) with the same EVM address the committed vector binds as DID 0; exit 1, log /out/logs/verify-2.log."
